silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_11_base_commutative_yoneda_hom_leg_8 silm:hasExample "In 'P07CrossPaperBridgesBridgeTo11BaseCommutativeYonedaHomLeg8', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the SHACL VetRecord shape constraining VetRecord_77 well-formedness: a validation-shape arrow into D_Mittens admitting evidence only when shape-valid." .
